WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.300 line:0%
And finally, New Rule.

00:00:01.433 --> 00:00:03.603 line:0%
If humanity can impose rules
on warfare,

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.171 line:0%
let's do something
really ambitious.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.240 line:0%
Let's try them on high school.
(SMACKS LIPS)

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:09.842 line:0%
Because our public schools
are no longer safe

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.410 line:0%
for the teachers.

00:00:12.144 --> 00:00:15.181 line:0%
A 15-year-old in Houston
this year sucker-punched

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:17.349
his teacher
for confiscating his phone

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.218
after screaming,
"Give me my phone,

00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:21.354
I told you to give me
my fucking phone."

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.089
-KID:<i> I told you
 to give me my phone.</i>
-Hey, Sprint,

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.490
you may have
a new spokesperson.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:31.530
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:33.699
In Florida,
a high school student beat

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:37.604
a teacher's aide unconscious
for taking his Nintendo Switch.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.639
-(AUDIENCE GROANING)
-Hitting the teacher?

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.007
I used to get sent
to the principal's office

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:43.309
for rolling my eyes.

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:45.211
-(AUDIENCE CHUCKLING)
-Go online.

00:00:45.377 --> 00:00:47.546
You can see endless videos
of this stuff.

00:00:47.613 --> 00:00:50.783
Of kids threatening
and punching teachers.

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:57.390
-What is this, JetBlue?
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.093
What have we let
our schools turn into?

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.395
A third of teachers
in America say

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.963
they've been harassed
or threatened.

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:08.701
And one in seven in this country
has been physically attacked.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:13.339
2023 kicked off with the story
of a six-year-old boy taking

00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:15.741
a gun to school
in Newport News, Virginia,

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.810
shooting his teacher,
and then declaring,

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:20.746
-"I shot that bitch dead."
-(AUDIENCE MURMURING)

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.716
Which would be a cool last line
for a Mickey Spillane novel.

00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:28.254
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-But a six-year-old?

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:31.824
The librarian at the school
added some context to the story,

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:38.832
saying... (READS PROMPT)

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:44.904
No wonder 50 percent
of teachers expressed a desire

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.706
to quit or transfer
to something less dangerous,

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.875
like walking Joe Biden's dog.

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:57.083
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:57.216 --> 00:01:59.619
No wonder 86 percent
of public schools

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:00.820
have a teacher shortage.

00:02:00.886 --> 00:02:03.222
Because 20 years ago,

00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:05.457
if you said
"American high school,"

00:02:05.557 --> 00:02:07.026
people pictured this.

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:11.497
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-Now, they picture this.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:18.037
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.607
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:23.008 --> 00:02:24.977
Only eight percent of schools

00:02:25.077 --> 00:02:27.680
say it's easy
to even find bus drivers.

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:31.083
Few weeks ago,
some Oklahoma middle schoolers

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.284
were acting up on the bus.

00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:33.786
So, the driver pulled over
and said

00:02:33.852 --> 00:02:36.122
he wasn't gonna go anywhere
until they quieted down.

00:02:36.455 --> 00:02:39.292
So, the kids immediately obeyed
because he was the adult.

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:42.628
-I'm joking, of course.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:42.694 --> 00:02:44.597
They went even more batshit.

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:46.966
<i> -Sit down!</i>
-(KIDS SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)

00:02:47.099 --> 00:02:49.702
<i> -No! Sit down!</i>
-(KIDS SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:52.371
And when school officials
reviewed video of the incident,

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:53.806
all those kids were punished.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.342
-(SCOFFS) I'm joking again.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:56.475 --> 00:02:58.544
Of course the kids
were given counseling

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.312
and the driver
was fired, arrested,

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:02.047
and charged with child abuse.

00:03:02.147 --> 00:03:04.984
And that
is the root of our problem.

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:08.154
Moms and dads used
to have the backs of teachers

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:09.188
and authority figures.

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:13.092
But now, their precious progeny
can never do anything wrong.

00:03:13.158 --> 00:03:15.294
So, it's made education
impossible.

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:16.529
And I know you're saying,

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:19.031
"Bill, what do you know
about it? You never had kids."

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:20.566
(CLICKS TONGUE) I know, jealous.

00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:27.240
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(LAUGHS)

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:29.875
But I know this.

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:32.345
A teacher today
looks out every morning

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:35.982
and sees 25 phones
distracting 25 kids.

00:03:36.249 --> 00:03:39.285
Undeterred by any authority
to pay attention

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:40.420
or even be civil.

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.021
And each kid represented

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:44.123
