legal defense team

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.425
-of mom and dad.
-(AUDIENCE CHUCKLING)

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:48.361
No, I'm sure
there are parents seeing this

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:51.130
and saying, "That's not us,
and this isn't our experience."

00:03:51.363 --> 00:03:53.966
True. Not all schools
are violent and scary.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:57.870
But they are all diploma mills
that allow students to graduate

00:03:57.937 --> 00:04:00.639
