the kids know basic shit.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:07.480
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-So--

00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:11.584
Twenty-five years ago,
George W. Bush asked,

00:04:11.717 --> 00:04:13.018
